  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag1.43" class="h1">Thag 1:43  Sumaṅgala</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>So freed! So freed!</p>
              <p>So thoroughly freed am I</p>
              <p>from three crooked things:</p>
              <p>my sickles, my shovels, my plows.</p>
              <p>Even if they were here,</p>
              <p class="v4">right here,</p>
              <p>I’d be done with them,</p>
              <p class="v4">done.</p>
              <p>Do jhāna, Sumaṅgala.</p>
              <p>Do jhāna, Sumaṅgala.</p>
              <p>Sumaṅgala, stay heedful.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../Thig/thig1_11.html">Thig 1:11</a>; <a href="../Thig/thig2_3.html">Thig 2:3</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
